<%if(current.equals("dashboard")){%>
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR CAMPUS, AT A GLANCE</div><h1>Good things are happening<span class="green">.</span></h1><p>Welcome back, <%=h(user.getName())%>. Here's what's taking shape on campus.</p></div><%if(manager){%><a class="button primary" href="app?page=create"><span>＋</span> Create event</a><%}else{%><a class="button primary" href="app?page=events">Explore events ↗</a><%}%></div>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE CAMPUS COLLECTIVE</span><h2>Big ideas.<br>Unforgettable <em>experiences.</em></h2><p>From the first spark to the final applause.<br>Bring your campus together, one event at a time.</p><a class="button cream" href="app?page=events">Explore what's on <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hero-ring ring-a"></div><div class="hero-ring ring-b"></div><span class="hero-star">✳</span><div class="hero-ticket"><span>ALL ACCESS TO</span><strong>Campus<br>life.</strong><div class="ticket-rule"></div><small>IDEAS. CONNECTIONS. MEMORIES.</small><div class="barcode"></div></div><div class="round-sticker">MAKE<br>IT HAPPEN<br>↗</div><span class="art-plus">+</span></div><span class="hero-edition">2026 / 27 &nbsp; — &nbsp; MAKE YOUR MARK</span></section>
<section class="stats" aria-label="Workspace statistics"><article><div>Total events <span>▦</span></div><strong><%=events.size()%><small>events</small></strong><p>Every idea, in one place</p></article><article><div>Ready to happen <span>↗</span></div><strong><%=approved%><small>approved</small></strong><p><span class="tiny-dot"></span> Ready for the next step</p></article><article><div><%=student?"My registrations":"Registrations"%> <span>♧</span></div><strong><%=registrations.size()%><small>sign-ups</small></strong><p>Bringing people together</p></article><article><div><%=student?"Notifications":"Awaiting approval"%> <span>◷</span></div><strong><%=student?notifications.size():pending%><small><%=student?"updates":"pending"%></small></strong><p><%=student?"Stay in the loop":"The next great thing is on its way"%></p></article></section>
