<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE REVIEW. A BIG DIFFERENCE.</div><h1>Ideas in the making<span class="green">.</span></h1><p><%=user.getRole().equals("ADMIN")?"Follow every event through the university approval process.":"Review your queue in order and help the next great campus moment happen."%></p></div><span class="step-pill"><%=waiting.size()%> AWAITING REVIEW</span></div><div class="approval-flow"><span><b>01</b> Faculty</span><i>→</i><span><b>02</b> HOD</span><i>→</i><span><b>03</b> Dean</span><small>The event level determines the final approver.</small></div>
